[1.9049, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;32r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[39;49m\u001b[?25l\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mHelp improve Hermes?\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mShared metrics are bounded counters: activity, outcomes, error classes (with a\r\u001b[3dfixed-list reason when a memory write, compression, update or install fails),\r\u001b[4dmodel routes, token totals, feature use and coarse machine facts. Never prompts,\r\u001b[5dfiles, paths, setting values or error text. Sharing sends them to Nous once a\r\u001b[6dday. Apart from a one-time install note, data from before you opt in is never\r\u001b[7dsent.\r\u001b[8dDetails: https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/developer-guide/relay-shared-metrics\r\u001b[9dChange it any time: hermes setup telemetry\r\u001b[10d\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  \u2191\u2193 navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\u001b[12;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m(\u25cb) Share with Nous\r\u001b[13d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m \u2192 (\u25cf) No thanks\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
